"{\"title\":\"Lunar Veil Legacy\",\"desc\":\"\\n\\nWelcome to Lunar Veil!\\n\\nThis is still an ongoing project with our upcoming 2.0 update! With massive amounts of content etc.\\n\\nI sincerely thank you for checking out this mod!, this mod as legacy is finalized so feel free to play with your friends, etc.\\nThis is a large content mod finished to the end on it's legacy build, see FAQ below for questions :)\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nFAQ\\n\\nIs this mod dead?\\nNope! Me and scolon are hard at work with 2.0! It'll be coming soon don't worry, and I'm sure you'll be pleasantly surprised with the scale of the update!\\nAfterall we did finish all of legacy within 8 months or so, and 2.0 has taken us 2 years by itself to do and we are in the endgame now, so hold tight!\\n\\n\\nCan I see 2.0?\\nWe have plenty of spoilers in the discord server, and if you ask me (Zenovia), you can also see stuff behind the scenes as well! I'm very open to\\nshowing people stuff even about 2.0, so come join the hype train! If you want to stalk us, we have a public github as well for devs and whatnot,\\nit is to hold us accountable for the things we do to ensure trust.\\n\\n\\nWhere's the discord server?\\nAt the bottom of the page.\\n\\n\\nRelease date?\\nWhoooo knows, maybe late this year (2026) or early next year, not too sure yet!\\n\\n\\nWhy this update?\\nWe just wanted to finalize legacy before we take it and turn it into it's own mod when it releases, keeping the mod up to date as well.\\n\\n\\nWhat will happen to legacy??\\nNothing particularly, we are going to upload it as a seperate mod when 2.0 releases, as the changes are so vast, we kind of have to.\\nAlso it's nice for people to be able to compare the old mod and the new one! And also for keeping old things alive I guess...\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWhat mods should I play with this?\\nAny really! But I can't ensure completely compatibility due to how many structures are in the mod, but heres a few that work really well:\\nThorium\\nSplit\\nMagic Storage\\nBoss Checklist (we have compatibility)\\nStars above\\nCalamity\\nStarlight river\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nChangelogs?\\nDown below are just a bunch of grouped up big changes we did during each update, for a super detailed one, we have it in the server or github.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPre~ 2.0 Stuff\\n\\n\\nPLEASE PLAY MASTERMODE or EXPERTMODE FOR THIS MOD!\\nMULTIPLAYER COMPATIBLE!!!\\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\n\\n\\n--------------------------------------------------------\\nThe Eternal Moon Update: 1.3 has been released finishng prehardmode and all of its glory!\\nGo out and fight the new bosses accompanied with a higher being Verlia, the one of the Moon.\\n--\\n1.3.1 - Added a few new weapons\\n1.3.2 - Rebalancing of items\\n1.3.3 - Enemy spawn reduction and loot changes\\n1.3.4 - Boss Checklist compatibility\\n----------------------------------\\nStars and Bloom update: 1.4 has been released, adding a bunch of QOL content, fixes and many more exploration!\\nThe Royal Capital, Catacombs, Veriplant biomes. Fenix, Sylia, Stone Golem and many minibosses were added. 90+ new weapons, over 40 new accessories and fixes!\\nThis update focuses on improving curent mechanics and adding an overall better vibe as well as a bunch of hardmode content as well as making the mod much more enjoyable!\\n----\\n1.4.1 - Some Generation fixes\\n1.4.2 - Texture configuration added, multiplayer stuff\\n1.4.2.1 - Fixed Dreadmire's phases breaking\\n1.4.2.2 - Fixed a lot of bugs and some item issues!\\n-----\\nPrismatic love Update: 1.5 has been released!\\nSee the new improvements across the mod containing 2 new bosses, MULTIPLAYER COMPATIBILITY and a bunch of new edits to make this mod feel super special! World generation differences and\\nsmall little parts, quests and remakes to make everything up to standard! Much balancing and new ways to pay, including many weapons and accessories to fill out other classes!\\n(Melee doesn't get much so go suck it). Cinderspark, Royal Capital overhaul, Veriplant overhaul, Xixian village and many underground structures were added! Harvesting now feels good as well!\\n----\\n1.5.1 - Some multiplayer fixes\\n1.5.2.5 - A lot of bug fixes and config option fixes\\n-----\\nGreen Sun Update: 1.6 Has been released!\\nIntroducing many new systems like weapon swapping, Dialogue, Pages, reworked undergrounds and environments and quests! 4 New Post plant - Post ML bosses! Gothivia, Rek, Supernova fragment and Niivi!\\nMany reworks to older bosses such as Verlia, Sylia, Dreadmire and Irradia! More npcs and many more structures as well as structure fixing from old bugs. Over 100+ new weapons with new weapon types such as\\nSteins, Greatswords, Orbs, Gun Holstering and more! Ove\",\"stats\":\"927.881 MB | 14 Aug, 2023 @ 2:30am | 13 Aug @ 5:30pm\",\"tags\":\"\"}"
